### [Mobile Expansion - Capacitor Support]

#### [MODIFY] [design-system.css](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/styles/design-system.css)
- Add CSS variables for safe-area insets to ensure content doesn't overlap with system UI (notches, status bars).
